WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,800
Boss, what should I do?

2
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:11,170
We are the same race

3
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:12,970
You can’t bear to look at me, the spiritual master, either.

4
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:14,570
Be beaten by a pig

5
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:16,170
You just wanted to eat me

6
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:17,770
Now you come to beg me again

7
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:18,970
Do you think I'm stupid?

8
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:20,170
You worm egg

9
00:00:20,170 --> 00:00:21,170
I am the spirit master

10
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:24,400
I order you sister now

11
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,600
Brother, I discovered that you are also charming.

12
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,800
It was my fault that I broke your Laochao before.

13
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:30,000
Now let me love you well

14
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,200
Go home and love your mother

15
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:32,400
We are not the same species

16
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,800
Too cruel

17
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,400
There is no nature at all

18
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,000
It’s really eye-catching

19
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:43,000
Deng Dalang, leave it to you

20
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,200
I'm dirty

21
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,400
You think I'm not busy

22
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:46,400
Don't have a tacit understanding

23
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,200
Can you make me a dignified spiritual master?

24
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,800
Die with some dignity

25
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,000
They've all been tortured into such a bear state.

26
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,200
How dignified is that?

27
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,200
Then do it

28
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:58,120
You useless piece of trash

29
00:00:58,120 --> 00:01:02,180
Boss, when are we going to Taoyuan tomorrow?

30
00:01:02,180 --> 00:01:06,720
Boss, what should I do with this kind of grass?

31
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:08,920
Why do I feel that you are about to get into trouble again?

32
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:14,590
you feel right

33
00:01:14,590 --> 00:01:16,190
This thing makes me uncomfortable

34
00:01:16,190 --> 00:01:21,180
Why don’t you feel uncomfortable when you are on the road while eating and drinking?

35
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:22,580
Boss, have you seen it?

36
00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:30,250
There's Taoyuan in front of me. I'll go there.

37
00:01:30,250 --> 00:01:31,440
Let me cover it up
